cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this project, please cite it as a research prototype."
title: "JOVIAN-AP: Data Assimilation with an OpenFOAM-Based Rotating-Flow Model of Jovian Jets and Vortices"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pradeep"
    given-names: "Koramutla"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
abstract: >
  JOVIAN-AP is an early-stage research prototype investigating data
  assimilation for a rotating-flow model inspired by Jovian atmospheric
  jets and vortices. The planned workflow compares model forecasts with
  synthetic observations and evaluates whether data assimilation improves
  reconstruction and prediction. Model implementation, verification,
  and quantitative results remain subject to development and testing.